- Lines 11–13 (`if (mb_count < 0)`): admitted set `mb_count >= 0`; excluded set `mb_count < 0`. Because the body is only `av_log`, both sets continue past the branch. Critical: `mb_count == 0` is in the admitted set and triggers no log at all.
